        "TileImage": "$($repository d262ec9c-97d0-4d92-97a6-f2f9e0378b86).Image",
        "Description": "Good morning 47. The organizers of the Indianapolis 500 are worried that the success of the race in Miami will cause people to look down on their race as lesser by comparison. As a result, they want the race in Miami to get some negative press and have contracted the ICA to make this happen. Killling two race officials should accomplish this. We leave you to prepare, and as always, good luck.",
